    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_batch.py` that moderates a batch of user messages and returns per-message decisions using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service for content moderation. This service is identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific calls to the Amazon Comprehend API. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887875339,
          "start": 1789887873072
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda18030001qmSeuLfVT6FZTK",
